#: ../../source/reference/generated/logs/pams.logs.ExecutionLog.rst:7
msgid "ExecutionLog"
msgstr ""

#: of pams.logs.base.ExecutionLog:1
msgid "Execution type log class."
msgstr "約定タイプのログクラス。"

#: of pams.logs.base.ExecutionLog:3
msgid "This log is usually generated when an order is executed on markets."
msgstr "このログは通常、市場で注文が約定したときに生成されます。"

#: of pams.logs.base.ExecutionLog:5
msgid ""
"``buy_transaction_fee`` and ``sell_transaction_fee`` are the transaction "
"fees charged to the buyer and the seller (0.0 if the market has no "
"transaction fee). The market adds both to the transaction fees that it "
"collects in the time step (see "
":func:`pams.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenues`)."
msgstr ""
"``buy_transaction_fee`` と ``sell_transaction_fee`` "
"は、買い手と売り手に課される取引手数料です（市場に取引手数料がない場合は "
"0.0）。市場は両方を、そのステップで徴収する取引手数料に加算します（:func:`pams.Market.get_transaction_fee_revenues`"
" を参照）。"

